			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Cyberpunk neon lyric video, same style as the previous clips: pure black background with a faint dark-blue grid and a few tiny floating bokeh light dots. The camera is completely static, locked in a straight-on, full-screen centered framing, no camera movement at all. Five Chinese characters slide across the screen one by one from right to left. At 0.00s, the character \"保\" slides in smoothly from the right edge of the screen to the exact center, with a slight playful overshoot and ease, leaving a soft cyan light trail behind it. It pauses at the center for a brief moment, floating gently with a tiny up-and-down bob while cyan and magenta neon particles swirl around it. Then at 0.65s it slides out smoothly toward the left edge and fully exits the screen, its light trail fading behind it. The character is a bold neon sign character in bright glowing cyan, sharp clean strokes, soft outer glow, fully legible. At 1.00s, the second character \"留\" slides in from the right edge to the center, now in bright glowing magenta, pauses briefly with a gentle bob, then slides out left with a magenta light trail. At 2.00s, the character \"几\" slides in from the right edge to the center in bright glowing cyan, pauses briefly, then slides out left. At 3.00s, \"分\" slides in and out in bright glowing magenta. At 4.00s, the final character \"啊\" slides in from the right edge to the center in bright glowing cyan, pauses briefly with a gentle bob, then slides out off the left edge of the screen. The five characters \"保留几分啊\" glide across the screen one after another like a smooth conveyor, each one fully exiting the left edge before the next one enters. All characters remain perfectly correct and legible, no missing strokes, no wrong characters. The entire video is completely silent, no audio at all.\n\noverall_soundscape: Complete silence. No ambient sound, no footsteps, no effects, no sound of any kind.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A. Silent video, no music.\n"
			],
